    mc "Finals schedule is up."

    orion "I know."

    mc "Physics is second to last."

    orion "I know."

    mc "That gives us-"

    orion "Eighteen days. Eleven of which are actually useful."

    narrator "You sit down."

    mc "You already mappedit out."

    orion "Eighteen days. Eleven of which are actually useful."

    narrator "You sit down."

    mc "You already mapped it out."

